GET {{users}}/api/v1/users/health

### C00.03 catalog-service -> 200
GET {{catalog}}/api/v1/catalog/health

### C00.04 university-service -> 200
GET {{university}}/api/v1/university/health

### C00.05 resource-service -> 200
GET {{resources}}/api/v1/resources/health

### C00.06 booking-service -> 200
GET {{bookings}}/api/v1/bookings/health

### C00.07 request-service -> 200
GET {{requests}}/api/v1/requests/health

### C00.08 event-service -> 200
GET {{events}}/api/v1/events/health

### C00.09 notification-service -> 200
GET {{notifications}}/api/v1/notifications/health

